---
title: "UML Activity Diagram — Alert Evaluation (every ALERTS_INTERVAL_MS or 'Check now')"
---
flowchart TD
  S([Start]) --> Q[Load enabled alerts]
  Q --> E{Any alerts?}
  E -- No --> X([End])
  E -- Yes --> F[Fetch BTC snapshot and/or fees<br/>once, via cache]
  F --> L[For each alert]
  L --> V{Data available<br/>and fresh?}
  V -- No --> N[Skip: leave state unchanged]
  V -- Yes --> C{Condition met?<br/>above: value ≥ threshold<br/>below: value ≤ threshold}
  C -- "Yes, was not met" --> T[Set conditionMet = true<br/>triggerCount + 1]
  T --> EV[Create AlertEvent<br/>observed value + source]
  C -- "Yes, already met" --> N
  C -- "No, was met" --> R[Re-arm: conditionMet = false]
  C -- "No, was not met" --> N
  EV --> M{More alerts?}
  R --> M
  N --> M
  M -- Yes --> L
  M -- No --> X
